  "term": "optimize",
  "definition": "In this social-policy context, optimize means to adjust rules or conditions so a system achieves the best attainable balance of goals, such as scale, diversity, and innovation. It implies using calibrated differences rather than one uniform approach when that better improves overall ecosystem functioning.",
